digraph account_payable_process_130 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_CFK5" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_CFK5"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_CFK5" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_CFK5" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_PEIQ" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_PEIQ"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_PEIQ" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_PEIQ" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_PEIQ" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_PEIQ"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_PEIQ"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_CFK5" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_PEIQ" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_CFK5"
		"gather the receiving report" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_CFK5"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_CFK5" -> "schedule the payment"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the senior accountant in your department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"schedule the payment" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the senior accountant in your department. 
After sending to the senior accountant in your department, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, one or more of the following paths should be executed: doubling check a three-way match, gathering the receiving report. 
When doubling check a three-way match is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: gathering the vendors invoice, confirming all documents have been amended. 
After that, scheduling the payment needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process and starts with sending the senior accountant in your department.
After delivering a deposit to a senior accountant in your department, you should create a receiving report.
After creating a receipt report, one or more of the following paths should be executed: Double Check a three-way match, collecting the receiving report.
When a three-way match is completed on a doubling check, one or more of the following paths should be executed : gathering the vendors invoice and confirming that all documents have been modified.
After that, scheduling must be completed the payment.
The process is now completed.
"
}
